This product includes software derived from Hurl
(https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/hurl), Copyright Orange,
licensed under the Apache License 2.0:
- internal/syntax is a Go port of Hurl's hurl_core parser (8.0.1); its Lint
  and highlighting port hurlfmt's linter and text formatter.
- internal/syntaxexport ports hurlfmt's JSON exporter and hurl_core's HTML
  formatter; internal/syntaxexport/hurl.css is Hurl's stylesheet,
  unchanged.
- testdata/conformance/hurlfmt and testdata/conformance/integration contain
  Hurl's formatter tests and integration test runner, unchanged.
- testdata/conformance/hurl contains Hurl's integration tests, unchanged.
- internal/jsonpath is a Go port of Hurl's JSONPath module (8.0.1).

This product includes test data from the jsonpath-compliance-test-suite
project (https://github.com/jsonpath-standard/jsonpath-compliance-test-suite),
licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License:
- internal/jsonpath/testdata/cts/cts.json is that project's compliance
